WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:15.000
A camera approaches a small outpost, with barracks on either side of a central road and a watchtower beyond.

00:15.000 --> 00:23.000
The camera moves past the front of a propeller aircraft displayed beside the courtyard.

00:23.000 --> 00:31.000
Blue particles rise above the watchtower among the surrounding trees.

00:31.000 --> 00:39.000
Material examples sit on plinths beside the workshop, showing different colours, patterns, and surface responses to light.

00:39.000 --> 00:47.000
Blue mist drifts across the yard near the signal gate.

00:47.000 --> 00:55.000
A closer view shows the tank's body and dark tread texture, with the Vanguard character standing beside the road.
